sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant UI as React terminal
    participant Main as Electron main process
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Device middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Operator->>UI: Authenticate terminal
    UI->>API: POST device challenge
    API->>DB: Check active device and store one-time challenge
    API-->>UI: Challenge ID and nonce
    UI->>Main: Sign nonce with OS-protected key
    Main-->>UI: Ed25519 signature
    UI->>API: POST device login with signature
    API->>DB: Consume challenge and verify registered public key
    API-->>UI: Short-lived access token

    Operator->>UI: Select customer, enter sale lines and payment
    UI->>API: POST /api/sales/invoices with bearer token
    API->>Auth: Validate token, device GUID, and active device
    Auth->>DB: Check terminal status
    DB-->>Auth: Device is active
    Auth-->>API: Allow request
    API->>DB: BEGIN; load business-date rates
    API->>API: Calculate category price and validate weight/entered price
    opt Price mismatch requires owner approval
        Note over Operator,UI: Operator enters PIN and selects owner override before submitting the invoice
        API->>DB: Verify scrypt PIN hash
    end
    API->>DB: Lock customer and inventory rows
    API->>DB: Insert invoice and item rows
    API->>DB: Update customer pending balance and inventory balance
    API->>DB: Add source-linked CASH inflow when cash received is positive
    opt Owner-approved price override
        API->>DB: Add immutable owner and price-override audit rows
    end
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: Invoice, line items, customer debt summary, rotated token
    UI-->>Operator: Show invoice and print option

    alt Validation or database operation fails
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: Error status and message
        UI-->>Operator: Show actionable error; do not report success
    end
